<title>CANADA: CIBC, Air Canada launch VISA card.</title>
<headline>CIBC, Air Canada launch VISA card.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce and Air Canada said they were starting a credit card called CIBC Vacation GOLD VISA card where one percent of purchases goes towards the purchase of an Air Canada vacation.</p>
<p>The card would also offer triple rewards when it was used to buy an Air Canada vacation package.</p>
<p>The card would have a C$39 annual fee and a minimum C$5,000 credit limit.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
